KeywordAbility(
    name: "emerge",
    params: [Cost],
    spelling: "emerge <Param(0)>",
    grammar: FixedKeyword(
        surface: "emerge",
    ),
    // STOP (waits on: `semantics-v2-linked-readback`).
    // "Emerge [cost]" is an alternative cost plus "its total cost is
    // reduced by an amount of generic mana equal to the sacrificed creature's mana value"
    // [CR#702.119a]. The reduction must name the creature the alternative cost sacrificed.
    // `PaidFacet` reads a paid cost's spent colors and mana, how often it was paid, whether
    // it was, and the player it chose (`chosenPlayer`), but no facet names the object a
    // paid cost acted on.
)
